        "Performance Features",
        "1. Simple structure. The impeller transmission bearing device is isolated from water and water‑borne materials, greatly avoiding bearing damage caused by water immersion, sand and contaminants.\n2. Very little loss of medium‑fine sand and stone powder. The gradation and fineness modulus of the washed construction sand meet the national standards of \"Sand for Construction\" and \"Pebble and Crushed Stone for Construction\".\n3. Except for the screen mesh, the machine has almost no wearing parts.\n4. Long service life, no maintenance required for a long period.",
        "",
