        ""
      ],
      [
        "Working Principle",
        "Driven by the motor and reducer, the impeller in the water tank continuously rotates circularly in the water tank, thereby stirring, turning and washing the sand‑gravel or slag granular materials in the water tank. The water‑borne materials are dewatered in the impeller and then discharged.",
